## API reference

### Newsletter

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title:` / `description:` / `note:` | `String` | translated | Heading, pitch and the line under the form (`nil` hides the pitch). |
| `action:` / `method:` | `String` / `Symbol` | - / `:post` | Where the form posts; without `action:` a demo. |
| `honeypot:` | `String` | `"website"` | Name of the hidden anti-spam field. |
| `socials:` | `Array` of `{ href:, icon:, label: }` | `[]` | Icon links under the form. |

### NewsletterPerk

`icon:` (default `:check`) in an outline tile, and the text as the block.
